nk.\""},{"spoiler":false,"text":"A girl who doesn't mingle with people because whatever she touches freezes."},{"spoiler":false,"text":"She lives alone in the castle she loves, but she decides by chance to go along with Thumbelina's invitation and join the journey."},{"spoiler":false,"text":"She acts cool and has a strong will, but she has a side that doesn't like to be alone."}],"source":"vndb","sourceCharacterId":"c43692"},{"segments":[{"spoiler":false,"text":"深緑の瞳の戦乙女。"},{"spoiler":false,"text":"天界きっての良家に育った血統書付き。"},{"spoiler":false,"text":"あどけなさが残る顔立ちをしているが、幼い頃より学んだ剣と魔法の腕は随一。"},{"spoiler":false,"text":"さらに兵法もみっちり仕込まれているため、作戦参謀としても超一流。"},{"spoiler":false,"text":"しかしながら、独断専行タイプで、情に欠ける言動が多いことが、他のヴァルキリー達から良い印象を持たれない要因になっている。"},{"spoiler":false,"text":"そのような問題はあっても、シグルドと並ぶ最強のヴァルキリーであることは変わらない。"},{"spoiler":false,"text":"彼女の子宮には世界樹に注がれる知恵の川の水門の鍵を宿しているというが……。"}],"source":"egs","sourceCharacterId":"24251","sourceWorkId":"8543","spoiler":false}],"profileFacts":[],"metadataCandidateConflicts":{},"image":{"url":"https://wiki-assets.bishojo.date/terminal-wiki/v1/characters/v1/images/0c/0c26cc0768526eaf1d5931fed9b887f9367b8fd8c5bd6a7f5c8752b5ef186ab9.webp","fallbackUrl":"https://wiki-assets.bishojo.date/terminal-wiki/v1/characters/v1/images/01/01654d0609007e8fdd88b85f77efcc704f099521bbb4a65fd094add9a2fc5de7.webp","width":171,"height":256,"source":"static-detail"},"actors":[{"creditedName":"高橋 花林","creatorId":"vndb:s8486","sourcePersonId":"vndb:s8486","canonicalEntityId":"vndb:s8486","name":"高橋 花林","roleCode":"voice-actor","roleLabel":"声优","identityStatus":"source-native","relationId":"vndb:vn-seiyuu:59011","source":"vndb"}]},{"characterId":"char_vndb_c43689","characterName":"シャルロッテ","sourceIds":{"vndbCharacterId":"c43689"},"originalCharacterName":"シャルロッテ","characterNameSource":null,"role":"main","status":"source-only-candidate","identityStatus":"source-authoritative","metadata":{"birthday":{"reviewState":"source-only","source":"vndb","value":"730"},"sex":{"reviewState":"source-only","source":"vndb","value":"f"}},"descriptions":[{"segments":[{"spoiler":false,"text":"\"I met a lot of people on this journey. Wonderful and fun things are coming to me!\""},{"spoiler":false,"text":"An energetic and slightly tomboyish girl that was raised in a country village."},{"spoiler":false,"text":"One day her body suddenly became small, just about as big as a thumb, and she began to be called 'Thumbelina'."},{"spoiler":false,"text":"Then her village was attacked and in order to evade her pursuers she started out on a journey with the Little Match Boy."}],"source":"vndb","sourceCharacterId":"c43689"}],"profileFacts":[],"metadataCandidateConflicts":{},"image":{"url":"https://wiki-assets.bishojo.date/terminal-wiki/v1/characters/v1/images/a4/a4cc8c8acf9ed16f9cf57a3284281d7e9459e047c5aed7b113ebb3c9ecbe049d.webp","fallbackUrl":"https://wiki-assets.bishojo.date/terminal-wiki/v1/characters/v1/images/35/3549c8de998b070ae3867c9fd4b84f943d1136e349847415dcb0d3575dbe30cf.webp","width":171,"height":256,"source":"static-detail"},"actors":[{"creditedName":"吉岡 麻耶","creatorId":"vndb:s5512","sourcePersonId":"vndb:s5512","canonicalEntityId":"vndb:s5512","name":"吉岡 麻耶","roleCode":"voice-actor","roleLabel":"声优","identityStatus":"source-native","relationId":"vndb:vn-seiyuu:59007","source":"vndb"}]},{"characterId":"char_vndb_c43690","characterName":"ラース・クリステンセン","sourceIds":{"vndbCharacterId":"c43690"},"originalCharacterName":"ラース・クリステンセン","characterNameSource":null,"role":"primary","status":"source-only-candidate","identityStatus":"source-authoritative","metadata":{"sex":{"reviewState":"source-only","source":"vndb","value":"m"}},"descriptions":[{"segments":[{"spoiler":false,"text":"\"I'll definitely protect you, because when you're beside me I feel relieved.\""},{"spoiler":false,"text":"Thumbelina's childhood friend who lives next door to her."},{"spoiler":false,"text":"His family is poor so he makes a living selling matches."},{"spoiler":false,"text":"He's a bit of a apathetic and sulky person, but at his root he is kind."},{"spoiler":false,"text":"He's going on an adventure with Thumbelina."}],"source":"vndb","sourceCharacterId":"c43690"}],"profileFacts":[],"metadataCandidateConflicts":{},"image":{"url":"https://wiki-assets.bishojo.date/terminal-wiki/v1/characters/v1/images/fe/feea659735a0889a23fa3c7a2a1db0380e2ca05981258daa03988ba7640dd037.webp","fallbackUrl":"https://wiki-assets.bishojo.date/terminal-wiki/v1/characters/v1/images/ed/ed09613f198792e3a201f4607095922b8d834e345d4ae78d4d0ad5334f94aeed.webp","width":171,"height":256,"source":"static-detail"},"actors":[{"creditedName":"山谷 祥生","creatorId":"vndb:s8331","sourcePersonId":"vndb:s8331","canonicalEntityId":"vndb:s8331","name":"山谷 祥生","roleCode":"voice-actor","roleLabel":"声优","identityStatus":"source-native","relationId":"vndb:vn-seiyuu:59010","source":"vndb"}]},{"characterId":"char_vndb_c43691","characterName":"リューン","sourceIds":{"vndbCharacterId":"c43691"},"originalCharacterName":"リューン","characterNameSource":null,"role":"primary","status":"source-only-candidate","identityStatus":"source-authoritative","metadata":{"sex":{"reviewState":"source-only","source":"vndb","value":"m"}},"descriptions":[{"segments":[{"spoiler":false,"text":"\"I go wherever I feel like going, I do whatever I feel like doing, I proceed naturally however I feel like. That's what freedom is.\""},{"spoiler":false,"text":"A hunter who travels freely without making connections with people."},{"spoiler":false,"text":"He doesn't like mixing with people, but because of the guidance of the wind he starts traveling together with Thumbelina."},{"spoiler":false,"text":"A guy who is hard to understand that goes at his own pace."}],"source":"vndb","sourceCharacterId":"c43691"}],"profileFacts":[],"metadataCandidateConflicts":{},"image":{"url":"https://wiki-assets.bishojo.date/terminal-wiki/v1/characters/v1/images/e6/e66cd3240aedcc7fd47dabbe393758ac4502d18776cfc9484ccf63244d75ce24.webp","fallbackUrl":"https://wiki-assets.bis