y."},{"spoiler":false,"text":"She's sensitive to other people's pain and has a kind heart."}],"source":"vndb","sourceCharacterId":"c43696"}],"profileFacts":[],"metadataCandidateConflicts":{},"image":{"url":"https://wiki-assets.bishojo.date/terminal-wiki/v1/characters/v1/images/8e/8e0f35a73a654df265d601efaa0e06813f687ed6fc35b8cc24547bd48f92da19.webp","fallbackUrl":"https://wiki-assets.bishojo.date/terminal-wiki/v1/characters/v1/images/a6/a68b20929e8ec206cc07cb97b6d9ec118c89f794e827c48e62e03e2cfc8d470c.webp","width":171,"height":256,"source":"static-detail"},"actors":[{"creditedName":"高橋 未奈美","creatorId":"vndb:s5751","sourcePersonId":"vndb:s5751","canonicalEntityId":"vndb:s5751","name":"高橋 未奈美","roleCode":"voice-actor","roleLabel":"声优","identityStatus":"source-native","relationId":"vndb:vn-seiyuu:59008","source":"vndb"}]},{"characterId":"char_vndb_c43697","characterName":"ゴビー","sourceIds":{"vndbCharacterId":"c43697"},"originalCharacterName":"ゴビー","characterNameSource":null,"role":"side","status":"source-only-candidate","identityStatus":"source-authoritative","metadata":{"sex":{"reviewState":"source-only","source":"vndb","value":"m"}},"descriptions":[{"segments":[{"spoiler":false,"text":"A loyal servant of Esheru that pulls her goldfish bowl satisfactorily."},{"spoiler":false,"text":"He's very strong and will always run to help his master when she's in a pinch."}],"source":"vndb","sourceCharacterId":"c43697"}],"profileFacts":[],"metadataCandidateConflicts":{},"image":{"url":"https://wiki-assets.bishojo.date/terminal-wiki/v1/characters/v1/images/ee/eecd0fe541f6529146b1e198cd54653893c6179660c4b41c25f16f8a4ac5da08.webp","fallbackUrl":"https://wiki-assets.bishojo.date/terminal-wiki/v1/characters/v1/images/bf/bfa96ec08da7581cec35c3e78dbe10c4f7db45654f23b08b59e89d6e147f684b.webp","width":230,"height":230,"source":"static-detail"},"actors":[{"creditedName":"入江 玲於奈","creatorId":"vndb:s7991","sourcePersonId":"vndb:s7991","canonicalEntityId":"vndb:s7991","name":"入江玲於奈","roleCode":"voice-actor","roleLabel":"声优","identityStatus":"source-native","relationId":"vndb:vn-seiyuu:59009","source":"vndb"}]},{"characterId":"char_vndb_c43698","characterName":"みにくいアヒルの子","sourceIds":{"vndbCharacterId":"c43698"},"originalCharacterName":"みにくいアヒルの子","characterNameSource":null,"role":"side","status":"source-only-candidate","identityStatus":"source-authoritative","metadata":{"sex":{"reviewState":"source-only","source":"vndb","value":"m"}},"descriptions":[{"segments":[{"spoiler":false,"text":"\"Hmm, If you want a fight I'll give it to you, you impotent bastard!!\""},{"spoiler":false,"text":"A grey duckling that escaped from a certain castle."},{"spoiler":false,"text":"He's coming along on the journey with Thumbelina as emergency rations."},{"spoiler":false,"text":"He's exceedingly frank and loves women. He often talks non-stop about indecent topics."}],"source":"vndb","sourceCharacterId":"c43698"}],"profileFacts":[],"metadataCandidateConflicts":{},"image":{"url":"https://wiki-assets.bishojo.date/terminal-wiki/v1/characters/v1/images/7c/7ccc873cbe68a3512d106fada134706fb03f46c30f5ebec4991c3247f8a01b64.webp","fallbackUrl":"https://wiki-assets.bishojo.date/terminal-wiki/v1/characters/v1/images/c3/c3f91b3d4037dcefcbde62c26246fdcd61b01b8b4d442841a6f7b3dbb79893cc.webp","width":171,"height":256,"source":"static-detail"},"actors":[{"creditedName":"柿原 徹也","creatorId":"vndb:s80","sourcePersonId":"vndb:s80","canonicalEntityId":"vndb:s80","name":"柿原 徹也","roleCode":"voice-actor","roleLabel":"声优","identityStatus":"source-native","relationId":"vndb:vn-seiyuu:58998","source":"vndb"}]},{"characterId":"char_vndb_c43699","characterName":"アルビレオ","sourceIds":{"vndbCharacterId":"c43699"},"originalCharacterName":"アルビレオ","characterNameSource":null,"role":"primary","status":"source-only-candidate","identityStatus":"source-authoritative","metadata":{"sex":{"reviewState":"source-only","source":"vndb","value":"m"}},"descriptions":[{"segments":[{"spoiler":false,"text":"\"Women aren't something you can pluck lightly. They're something you offer yourself up with all your might to be engulfed by.\""},{"spoiler":false,"text":"A young man with beautiful white wings that appears gallantly in front of Thumbelina."},{"spoiler":false,"text":"He's actually the transformed form of the Ugly Duckling."},{"spoiler":false,"text":"A smug gentleman who is a little overbearing. He calls himself the 'Sexy Attendant'."},{"spoiler":false,"text":"He gives off a trivial impression, but he is actually good with the sword and has a helpful side."}],"source":"vndb","sourceCharacterId":"c43699"}],"profileFacts":[],"metadataCandidateConflicts":{},"image":{"url":"https://wiki-assets.bishojo.date/terminal-wiki/v1/characters/v1/images/c3/c3f00282d2893201c4e61ec358229bc741f1b5f9b1fb374643427b82914a6aa0.webp","fallbackUrl":"https://wiki-assets.bishojo.date/terminal-wiki/v1/characters/v1/images/d3/d397cf9cf3962e5b68b511896bceeda2e3fbda3043fd308809a4afe93de4deed.webp","width":171,"height":256,"source":"static-detail"},"actors":[{"creditedName":"柿原 徹也","creatorId":"vndb:s80","sourcePersonId":"vndb:s80","canonicalEntityId":"vndb:s80","name":"柿原 徹也","roleCode":"voice-actor","roleLabel":"声优","identityStatus":"source-native","relationId":"vndb:vn-seiyuu:58999","source":"vndb"}]},{"characterId":"char_vndb_c43700","characterName":"ジークヴァルト","sourceIds":{"vndbCharacterId":"c43700"},"originalCharacterName":"ジークヴァルト","characterNameSource":null,"role":"primary","status":"source-only-candidate","identityStatus":"source-authoritative","metadata":{"sex":{"reviewState":"source-only","source":"vndb","value":"m"}},"descriptions":[{"segments":[{"spoiler":false,"text":"\"Touching you with these hands that are stained with sin... Please forgive me. I have the resolve to bear this responsibility.\""},{"spoiler":false,"text":"A swallow that loves spring. He's bound by a charm and has lived for a hundred years while transformed into a human."},{"spoiler":false,"text":"He swore loyalty to his once kind king, and decided to live for that kings sake."},{"spoiler":false,"text":"He is a kind and gentle man, but his sword arm is the best in the kingdom."}],"source":"vndb","sourceCharacterId":"c43700"}],"profileFacts":[],"metadataCandidateConflicts":{},"image":{"url":"https://wiki-assets.bishojo.date/terminal-wiki/v1/characters/v1/images/0e/0e996fde6e9f4d43f5f1bc989833d8060766e7d6bdafecb6325c43712856d2e5.webp","fallbackUrl":"https://wiki-assets.bishojo.date/terminal-wiki/v1/characters/v1/images/18/18e023c3ff502635902e5f97d6f844454157213971a14ee5709c30bfe179bca8.webp","width":171,"height":256,"source":"static-detail"},"actors":[{"creditedName":"桐本 琢也","creatorId":"vndb:s2171","sourcePersonId":"vndb:s2171","canonicalEntityId":"vndb:s2171","name":"桐本 琢也","roleCode":"voice-actor","roleLabel":"声优","identityStatus":"source-native","relationId":"vndb:vn-seiyuu:59003","source":"vndb"}]},{"characterId":"char_vndb_c43701","characterName":"黒騎士","sourceIds":{"vndbCharacterId":"c43701"},"originalCharacterName":"黒騎士","characterNameSource":null,"role":"side","status":"source-only-candidate","identityStatus":"source-authoritative","metadata":{"sex":{"reviewState":"source-only","source":"vndb","value":"m"}},"descriptions":[{"segments":[{"spoiler":false,"text":"\"...If you intend to get in my way than that's enough of a reason to kill you. Fall into Hell.\""},{"spoiler":false,"text":"A loyal subordinate of the king of Odense who serves him with absolute power."},{"spoiler":false,"text":"On the King's order he spearheaded the attack on Thumbelina's village."},{"spoiler":false,"text":"He has a callous personality and could even easily kill his own subordinates."}],"source":"vndb","sourceCharacterId":"c43701"}],"profileFacts":[],"metadataCandidateConflicts":{},"image":{"url":"https://wiki-assets.bishojo.date/terminal-wiki/v1/characters/v1/images/e8/e811b99b9ffc34f109305522f1bbf0cac770a818a142d0eeac34f6a47a8afea1.webp","fallbackUrl":"https://wiki-assets.bishojo.date/terminal-wiki/v1/characters/v1/images/a8/a8292f7164d5a07773a95281629b7cee0e4f68cd793cc7f0e6e03f194c245daa.webp","width":171,"height":256,"source":"static-detail"},"actors":[{"creditedName":"桐本 琢也","creatorId":"vndb:s2171","sourcePersonId":"vndb:s2171","canonicalEntityId":"vndb:s2171","name":"桐本 琢也","roleCode":"voice-actor","roleLabel":"声优","identityStatus":"source-native","relationId":"vndb:vn-seiyuu:59004","source":"vndb"}]},{"characterId":"char_vndb_c43703","characterName":"裸の王様","sourceIds":{"vndbCharacterId":"c43703"},"originalCharacterName":"裸の王様","characterNameSource":null,"role":"primary","status":"source-only-candidate","identityStatus":"source-authoritative","metadata":{"sex":{"reviewState":"source-only","source":"vndb","value":"m"}},"descriptions":[{"segments":[{"spoiler":false,"text":"\"I'm the naked king who holds nothing and wears nothing. Besides this power of darkness of course.\""},{"spoiler":false,"text":"He was once a kind king who loved his country."},{"spoiler":false,"text":"But he made a contract with a person of darkness and gained a great power and was corrupted. He started scheming to sink the world into darkness."},{"spoiler":false,"text":"There is no trace of his former self left, he's now selfish and arrogant."},{"spoiler":true,"text":"For the majority of the game he is possessed by Loki."}],"source":"vndb","sourceCharacterId":"c43703"}],"profileFacts":[],"metadataCandidateConflicts":{},"image":{"url":"https://wiki-assets.bishojo.date/terminal-wiki/v1/characters/v1/images/32/32245e7bf6fa23c40fc69ba730bf22c59cc17f1151ed0c678c7a7e7c36814149.webp","fallbackUrl":"https://wiki-assets.bishojo.date/terminal-wiki/v1/characters/v1/images/98/98fce3ea2aca5927f61206b12508e1fe2ec916090d197b6bb25e9ec74c08ba96.webp","width":171,"height":256,"source":"static-detail"},"actors":[{"creditedName":"黒田 崇矢","creatorId":"vndb:s170","sourcePersonId":"vndb:s170","canonicalEntityId":"vndb:s170","name":"黒田 崇矢","roleCode":"voice-actor","roleLabel":"声优","identityStatus":"source-native","relationId"